================================================================================
DETECTION RULESETS
================================================================================

The detection patterns in `rules/` are original work, authored for this
repository.

Where a pattern matches a credential, identifier, or document format defined
by a published specification, it encodes that specification directly. Examples
include vendor-documented API token prefixes (`ghp_`, `sk-ant-`, `xoxb-`),
RFC 5322 email syntax, the North American Numbering Plan, the US Social
Security Administration number format, ISO 13616 IBAN structure, and
government-published national identifier formats and check-digit algorithms.
These specifications are facts published by their respective issuers and carry
no attribution obligation.

No ruleset in this repository is a derivative work of a third-party pattern
bank.
